{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125075327539-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125080654\"/><p>事主被送往東區醫院治理。</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今晨(25日)7時19分，一輛電車駛經英皇道近琴行街時，撞倒一名過路婦，婦人受傷清醒，由救護車送往東區醫院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，在書局街的西行線電車服務暫停。市⺠請考慮使⽤其他公共運輸服務。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:23:52.619962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:53:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:24.205110+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:24.205110+00:00","content_hash":"f2d984d4310546a5e72f5e97904ffa03133835e6864a7610b4642230e3175cca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}